---
import AuthoringLayout from '../../../layouts/AuthoringLayout.astro';
---
<AuthoringLayout title="Aether playground" capability="playground:read">
  <p>Private staff sandbox. Only submit examples you have permission to use. Production conversations are never imported automatically. Training creates a candidate; it does not activate a production model.</p>
  <section class="staff-card" aria-labelledby="connection-heading"><h2 id="connection-heading">Connection and readiness</h2><p data-pg-status></p><p data-pg-setup hidden>Setup required: ask the Aether server owner to implement the version 1 playground contract and configure the approved server identity, monitoring and administration credentials. Local examples remain editable. See the Admin guide &amp; setup and server handoff documentation.</p><form data-admission><label>Admission reason<textarea name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" required /> I confirm this changes server inference admission.</label><button name="pause" value="true" type="submit">Pause inference</button><button name="pause" value="false" type="submit">Resume inference</button></form></section>
  <section class="staff-card"><h2>Sandbox conversation</h2><form data-sandbox><label>Approved model<select name="modelId" required></select></label><label>System context<textarea name="system" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label><label>User prompt<textarea name="prompt" maxlength="4000" required></textarea></label><label>Output token limit<input name="maxOutputTokens" type="number" value="512" min="1" max="1024" required /></label><label>Temperature<input name="temperature" type="number" value="0.7" min="0" max="2" step="0.1" required /></label><button type="submit">Generate sandbox response</button></form><button data-reset-conversation type="button">Reset conversation</button><p data-context-note role="status"></p><div data-transcript role="log" aria-label="Sandbox conversation transcript"></div><pre data-answer style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere"></pre><button data-save-answer type="button" disabled>Copy response into example editor</button><p>The transcript stays only in this page’s memory until reset, sign-out or access loss. Changing the model or system context starts a new conversation. Only the current response is copied into the example editor.</p></section>
  <section class="staff-card"><h2>Example editor</h2><p>Saving an edit invalidates any earlier approval. Example prompts must be self-contained: include any context needed to understand the current user question before approving. Known credential patterns are masked before saving; inspect text for any other sensitive content.</p><form data-example><label>Title<input name="title" maxlength="120" required /></label><label>Example model ID<input name="modelId" maxlength="120" required /></label><label>Example prompt<textarea name="prompt" maxlength="4000" required></textarea></label><label>Actual response<textarea name="response" maxlength="12000"></textarea></label><label>Expected response<textarea name="expectedResponse" maxlength="12000"></textarea></label><label>Evaluation notes<textarea name="notes" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label>Evaluation<select name="rating"><option value="">Not rated</option><option value="good">Good</option><option value="needs-work">Needs work</option><option value="unsafe">Unsafe</option></select></label><button type="submit">Save example for review</button><button data-new-example type="button">New example</button></form><p data-example-count></p><div data-examples></div><button data-more type="button" hidden>Load next example page</button></section>
  <section class="staff-card"><h2>Train a candidate</h2><form data-training><label>Approved base model<select name="baseModelId" required></select></label><label>Server-approved preset<select name="presetId" required></select></label><label>Training reason<textarea name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label><input name="acknowledgeTraining" type="checkbox" required /> I have permission to use these approved examples and understand training uses server resources and does not activate a model.</label><button type="submit">Submit selected approved examples</button></form><h3>Private training jobs</h3><p>Unknown means acceptance is uncertain. Reconcile the original request before submitting another job.</p><div data-jobs></div></section>
</AuthoringLayout>
<script>import '../../../scripts/aetherPlayground';</script>

<style>form { display:grid; gap:1rem; margin-block:1rem; } label { display:grid; gap:.4rem; } label:has(input[type="checkbox"]) { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; } input[type="checkbox"] { width:auto; } section { margin-block:2rem; min-width:0; } pre { max-width:100%; } :global([data-examples] article), :global([data-jobs] article) { border:1px solid #345646; padding:1rem; margin-block:1rem; overflow-wrap:anywhere; } :global([data-examples] button), :global([data-jobs] button) { margin:.4rem; }</style>
